      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "impact_statement": "The maintainer advisory explicitly affects >=0.11.0,<0.12.1. Version 0.10.4 predates the inline cursor implementation. OSV currently overmatches the older version. Version 0.12.0 was upgraded to 0.12.1.",
      "references": [
